'''Mark of Dominus''' is a [[debuff]] cast onto the player character by [[Dominus]] and his map variants: [[God's Chosen]] and [[The High Templar]]. It sends [[Miscreation]]s against the target (usually the player character), causing Miscreations to chase the target and explode.

